abstract: >-
  Pedagogical note on the Fock-state quadrature variances n + 1/2 of the
  quantum harmonic oscillator, the unit step between adjacent rungs, and the
  ML Identity family of consecutive-integer identities. This deposit is an
  unrefereed preprint. The paper, figures, and text are licensed under
  CC BY 4.0; the code is licensed under MIT.
